sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as Cloud Scheduler
    participant SVC as Cloud Run<br/>new-deal-review-agent
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant TQ as Cloud Tasks
    participant GR as MS Graph<br/>(mailbox)
    participant GEM as Gemini<br/>(ADK agent)
    participant AS as Asana
    participant SF as Salesforce
    participant SP as SharePoint

    Note over SCH,SP: Workflow 1 - Purchase Acknowledgement email to populated task + document pack

    SCH->>SVC: POST /jobs/poll (OIDC)
    SVC->>GR: delta query on shared mailbox since watermark
    GR-->>SVC: new messages
    SVC->>SVC: filter PA emails by subject/sender rule
    SVC->>FS: dedupe on internetMessageId
    FS-->>SVC: not seen before

    SVC->>GEM: extract name, description, delivery date,<br/>period (MMM YYYY), quote number
    GEM-->>SVC: structured PA fields + confidence

    alt confidence below threshold
        SVC->>FS: stage = needs_human, reason recorded
        SVC->>AS: comment on tracker for analyst review
    else confident
        SVC->>FS: create deal case keyed on quote number
        SVC->>AS: upsert task in FY'27 Deal Review Tracker<br/>(write only empty fields)
        AS-->>SVC: task gid
        SVC->>FS: stage task_created = done, evidence = task gid
    end

    SVC->>TQ: enqueue advance(case_id), dedupe key = quote number
    TQ->>SVC: POST /internal/advance

    Note over SVC,SP: Track A - signed quote only, this is the critical path

    SVC->>SF: query Quote by quote number, list attached files
    SF-->>SVC: ContentVersion list + agreements
    SVC->>GEM: which file is the executed (signed) quote?
    GEM-->>SVC: signed quote content id + confidence
    SVC->>SF: download signed quote PDF
    SVC->>SP: ensure path customer / New Deals / <month>, upload
    SVC->>FS: signed_quote_in = done, store content hash

    Note right of SVC: amendment analysis can start NOW.<br/>It needs nothing else from the pack.

    Note over SVC,SP: Track B - rest of the pack, best effort, never blocks

    SVC->>GEM: classify remaining files - TAF / PO /<br/>master agreement (EULA, End User, SLA, SaaS)
    GEM-->>SVC: labels + confidence
    SVC->>SF: download matched files
    Note right of SF: all documents are attached at<br/>Closed/Won, so this is normally<br/>a single pass, not a chase
    SVC->>SP: upload (skip files already present)
    SP-->>SVC: item ids
    SVC->>FS: record per-document evidence

    alt pack complete
        SVC->>FS: pack_complete
    else something missing
        SVC->>FS: pack_partial, note which documents are missing
        Note right of FS: reconciler retries only the missing items.<br/>Enrichment and the DRS proceed regardless.
    end
